# MIW configuration. Every key here is OPTIONAL.
#
# The ground-truth path is deterministic and needs no credentials: authoritative
# claims come from fetching each tool's own pages (changelog, pricing, deprecation,
# status) and quoting them verbatim. Run `python3 main.py run-weekly` with this file
# absent and you still get cited, authoritative findings.
#
# What the keys add:
#   TAVILY_API_KEY       discovery of replacement tools we have never heard of, and
#                        indexed lookup *within* a vendor's own domains. Without it,
#                        only vendor-named successors are surfaced.
#   OPENROUTER_API_KEY   LLM synthesis of recommendation prose. Without it,
#                        recommendations are composed from templates. The LLM is never
#                        a source of facts.
#   GITHUB_TOKEN         raises the GitHub API rate limit for repo archived/staleness
#                        checks. Unauthenticated works but throttles at ~60 req/hour.

# TAVILY_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
# GITHUB_TOKEN=

# House convention: Claude for reasoning, a cheap fast model for bulk validation.
LLM_MODEL=anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5
VALIDATION_LLM_MODEL=google/gemini-2.5-flash
LLM_BASE_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1

# Research budget per weekly run.
RESEARCH_MAX_DEPS=40
ROTATION_SLICE=12
